        "duration": 28863209
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "加、减、搬运、跳转，全靠它区分。",
        "offset": 29363209,
        "duration": 39504719
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "地址这个词要小心，它是一个统称。",
        "offset": 68867928,
        "duration": 31603775
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "它可以是内存地址，代号 addr。",
        "offset": 100471703,
        "duration": 31603775
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "可以是寄存器编号，代号 reg。",
        "offset": 132075478,
        "duration": 29009435
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "也可以直接是一个立即数，代号 imm。",
        "offset": 161084914,
        "duration": 36910379
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "同一个位置，放的东西不同，取数的方式就不同。",
        "offset": 197995293,
        "duration": 42334907
